/**
 * SkipLink: first focusable element in the DOM. Lets a keyboard or
 * screen-reader user bypass the header and reach page content directly.
 *
 * Styling lives in src/styles/base/a11y.css (`.skip-link`): visually hidden
 * until focused, then visible at `--z-skiplink` with the standard focus ring.
 *
 * Absent from the prototype (X24, docs/08 section 1).
 */
---

<a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to main content</a>
